{
  "source": "Prompts/does-school-matter-7.mp4",
  "duration": 185.69,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.06,
      "text": "A lot of students are looking at their screens right now and asking a very reasonable question."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.94,
      "end": 11.02,
      "text": "If an AI can generate the answer to almost anything in a few seconds, why do you still"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.02,
      "end": 13.3,
      "text": "need to sit through years of traditional classes?"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.02,
      "end": 17.76,
      "text": "It is incredibly tempting to just hand over the heavy lifting."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.36,
      "end": 22.88,
      "text": "You type a prompt, and the tool effortlessly spits out your essay drafts, your computer"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.88,
      "end": 24.72,
      "text": "code, and your project plans."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.6,
      "end": 27.36,
      "text": "But let's fast-forward a few years."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.86,
      "end": 29.46,
      "text": "You've landed your dream job."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.1,
      "end": 33.7,
      "text": "You sit at your test goal day, and an AI assistant is right there with you."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.3,
      "end": 37.42,
      "text": "Your coworker at the next desk is doing the exact same thing."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.88,
      "end": 41.0,
      "text": "You both have the same job and use the exact same AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.74,
      "end": 46.88,
      "text": "Because you both have equal access to the same technology, the tool itself no longer"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.88,
      "end": 48.04,
      "text": "gives you a competitive edge."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.64,
      "end": 53.96,
      "text": "The only thing that sets your work apart is what you do after the AI gives you its first response."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.66,
      "end": 58.48,
      "text": "Imagine your boss asks you and your coworker to plan a new product launch."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.12,
      "end": 64.2,
      "text": "Naturally, you both ask the AI similar questions, and you both get similar baseline plans back."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.92,
      "end": 67.4,
      "text": "This comparison board breaks down what happens next."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.92,
      "end": 72.04,
      "text": "It shows exactly how the two of you handle those identical AI-generated plans."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.72,
      "end": 73.84,
      "text": "We'll start with the sales projections."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.86,
      "end": 79.9,
      "text": "Your coworker looks at the numbers the AI provided and simply accepts them, without critical thought."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.62,
      "end": 82.44,
      "text": "Using the math skills you learned in school,"
    },
    {
      "start": 82.96,
      "end": 86.2,
      "text": "you work through the costs and find a more profitable pricing option."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.86,
      "end": 88.34,
      "text": "Next is the customer email."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.26,
      "end": 93.4,
      "text": "Your coworker copies and pastes the message exactly as the AI wrote it."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.98,
      "end": 96.36,
      "text": "Using the writing skills you developed in English class,"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.82,
      "end": 99.24,
      "text": "you make the message clearer and more persuasive."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.3,
      "end": 103.6,
      "text": "The raw AI output you both started with was functionally identical."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.24,
      "end": 107.44,
      "text": "But by applying the disciplines you learned in math in English,"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.44,
      "end": 111.82,
      "text": "you transformed those generic responses into valuable business assets."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.74,
      "end": 114.74,
      "text": "Finally, we reach the market research phase."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.64,
      "end": 120.1,
      "text": "Your coworker accepts the AI's findings without bothering to check any of the underlying sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.82,
      "end": 122.8,
      "text": "Using the research skills you developed in school,"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.34,
      "end": 126.62,
      "text": "you compare sources and identify a more promising group of customers."
    },
    {
      "start": 127.38,
      "end": 128.44,
      "text": "The tool may be the same."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.2,
      "end": 130.26,
      "text": "What you bring to it is yours."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.1,
      "end": 134.88,
      "text": "You started with similar AI answers, you ended with different work."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.64,
      "end": 138.66,
      "text": "Knowing what questions to ask, how to improve an argument,"
    },
    {
      "start": 139.0,
      "end": 141.62,
      "text": "and what evidence to investigate are not abilities"
    },
    {
      "start": 141.62,
      "end": 144.0,
      "text": "that spontaneously appear the day you get hired."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.84,
      "end": 148.24,
      "text": "You build those specific instincts through the friction of writing papers,"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.7,
      "end": 150.94,
      "text": "solving math problems, and weighing evidence in school."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.78,
      "end": 155.48,
      "text": "This infographic outlines two pillars of capability school helps construct."
    },
    {
      "start": 156.36,
      "end": 159.66,
      "text": "First is knowledge, going deep into a subject to become an expert."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.5,
      "end": 164.04,
      "text": "Second is skills, practicing critical thinking,"
    },
    {
      "start": 164.4,
      "end": 165.82,
      "text": "writing, and weighing evidence."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.52,
      "end": 168.52,
      "text": "School builds what you bring to the work."
    },
    {
      "start": 169.18,
      "end": 172.54,
      "text": "To be smarter than the tool, find what interests you, and go deep."
    },
    {
      "start": 173.44,
      "end": 175.9,
      "text": "Your knowledge and hone skills cannot be outsourced."
    },
    {
      "start": 176.84,
      "end": 178.88,
      "text": "The opportunity to learn is in front of you."
    },
    {
      "start": 179.44,
      "end": 181.36,
      "text": "Choose something you want to get better at."
    },
    {
      "start": 181.78,
      "end": 182.18,
      "text": "Start there."
    }
  ],
